ire a compatible release and separate secret-mapping updates.","findings":["review:5465968743"],"length":3733,"offset":0,"sha256":"e06f823212a5473afefff2d1d0abad16fac6f29592b9e3d20670f8d518f6f9fa","summary":"Forward the optional Copilot review fallback token to canary callers","upsides":"Configured fallback review requests can run through every legacy canary entry path. Regression coverage preserves the older pinned stable callers and the classifier/publisher token boundary."}],"findings":[{"analysis":"The hidden previously-missed finding is warranted despite the review summary reporting zero open findings: reusable-workflow secrets are explicitly mapped and none of the three canary callers forwarded the declared fallback token. All now forward it; all three pinned stable calls are unchanged. The two resolved details already have retry-state persistence and explicit no-fallback gate-release documentation, so those need no further code changes.","disposition":"fixed","downsides":"Fallback availability for the older pinned stable workflows is intentionally unchanged; this candidate does not establish live GitHub delivery or target CI clearance.","key":"review:5465968743","upsides":"Setting the documented fallback secret now enables availability detection and publisher delivery on all legacy canary paths; the targeted regression reproduced all three missing mappings before the fix."}],"input_identity":{},"outcome":"fixes","request_digest":"d48451876eee588fce3d64479994999c499727de0dc518f89a7b79c83988bc34","schema":2},"download_sha256":"9251fc9110bc5d6f611ae8588ef4712664a5224207686b9a229103cc5b833d3e","frozen_sha":"06b6dae928dc61c493f260723cdf35d030f364f7","pr":452,"publication_eligible":false,"repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","request_digest":"d48451876eee588fce3d64479994999c499727de0dc518f89a7b79c83988bc34","request_id":"ee5426c15a344973b3dafa8d086fd08c","run_attempt":1,"run_id":37888519154,"schema":2,"scope":"Structural/Git verification only. No target code or tests are executed.","server_artifact_digest":"sha256:9251fc9110bc5d6f611ae8588ef4712664a5224207686b9a229103cc5b833d3e","verification":"verified","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":37889319455},"workflow_revision":"eadecd0ffce9590595791925dd85130dae808235"},"request":{"authorized_actor_id":218610,"baseline_review_ids":[5464843292,5465783898,5465939326,5465943138,5465968743],"budgets":{"max_iterations":5,"propagation_seconds":120,"retention_days":14,"worker_timeout_minutes":30},"commit_author":{"id":218610,"login":"trask"},"findings":[{"body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udd35 Needs a closer look\n\nThe primary legacy workflow does not forward the fallback secret to its same-ref canary reusable-workflow calls.\n\n**0 open findings**\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>2 resolved since last review</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Persist merged fallback state across CAS retry failures](#discussion_r4226680419)\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/low-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Low severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Document Copilot gate release behavior without fallback](#discussion_r4226680469)\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Previously missed (1)</strong></summary>\n\nIn code that hasn't changed since last review\n\n<details>\n<summary><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> Forward the dashboard secret from same-ref canary callers</summary>\n\n`.github/\u200bworkflows/\u200bpull-request-dashboard-repo.yml:28`\n\n`pull-request-dashboard.yml` never forwards this newly declared secret: every current same-ref canary call maps only `PR_DASHBOARD_PRIVATE_KEY` and `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`, and reusable-workflow secrets are not inherited implicitly. Consequently the canary `update-dashboard` always sees fallback availability as false and `publish-dashboard` receives an empty token, so configuring the documented organization secret cannot exercise this feature through the legacy entry point. Forward the secret from the same-ref canary callers (while leaving callers pinned to the older workflow unchanged until that workflow is promoted).\n</details>\n</details>\n\n\ud83e\udde0 **Review effort:** Balanced","comment_id":null,"key":"review:5465968743","kind":"body","line":null,"path":null,"review_id":5465968743}],"frozen_at":1791523430,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-09T05:23:50Z","frozen_sha":"06b6dae928dc61c493f260723cdf35d030f364f7","head_ref":"trask-copilot-review-loop","head_repo":"open-telemetry/shared-workflows","head_repo_id":1279488627,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":37884850288},"loop_kind":"copilot_review","mode":"publish","pr":452,"protocol":"reviewable-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fin